  "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><meta name=\"typography\" content=\"classic\" /><h2 data-lake-id=\"cf393afe\" id=\"cf393afe\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua18707f5\" id=\"ua18707f5\">1. 压缩格式的介绍</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"ud7cb4a86\" id=\"ud7cb4a86\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u1eeeeb0b\" id=\"u1eeeeb0b\"><span data-lake-id=\"ucb466d70\" id=\"ucb466d70\">Linux默认支持的压缩格式:</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u4da76765\" id=\"u4da76765\"><br></p><ul list=\"uf0ea9c31\"><li fid=\"u36e40510\" data-lake-id=\"u1bb84bc5\" id=\"u1bb84bc5\"><span data-lake-id=\"uaf2a67c1\" id=\"uaf2a67c1\">.gz</span></li><li fid=\"u36e40510\" data-lake-id=\"uaabce93a\" id=\"uaabce93a\"><span data-lake-id=\"u47d84461\" id=\"u47d84461\">.bz2</span></li><li fid=\"u36e40510\" data-lake-id=\"u1ab988e7\" id=\"u1ab988e7\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub27cfcdf\" id=\"ub27cfcdf\">.zip</span></li><li fid=\"u36e40510\" data-lake-id=\"u963eb120\" id=\"u963eb120\"><span data-lake-id=\"u54ddfa20\" id=\"u54ddfa20\">.tar</span></li><li fid=\"u36e40510\" data-lake-id=\"u12d63ccf\" id=\"u12d63ccf\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6422759e\" id=\"u6422759e\">.</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u7eb41ce4\" id=\"u7eb41ce4\">tar.gz</span></strong></li><li fid=\"u36e40510\" data-lake-id=\"ufc268311\" id=\"ufc268311\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u20c0b97f\" id=\"u20c0b97f\">.tgz</span></strong></li></ul><p data-lake-id=\"u48dfe97d\" id=\"u48dfe97d\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u1dce431b\" id=\"u1dce431b\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uc530b1c2\" id=\"uc530b1c2\">说明:</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id=\"uf7b40f47\" id=\"uf7b40f47\"><br></p><ul list=\"u76b6494f\"><li fid=\"ubd215035\" data-lake-id=\"ub34ae44d\" id=\"ub34ae44d\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6ccbe6a0\" id=\"u6ccbe6a0\">.gz和.bz2的压缩包需要使用tar命令来压缩和解压缩</span></li><li fid=\"ubd215035\" data-lake-id=\"uf780f100\" id=\"uf780f100\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5063b138\" id=\"u5063b138\">.zip的压缩包需要使用zip命令来压缩，使用unzip命令来解压缩</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id=\"u3f03f8ca\" id=\"u3f03f8ca\"><br></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"1f8db80a\" id=\"1f8db80a\"><span data-lake-id=\"u76a09a46\" id=\"u76a09a46\">2. tar命令及选项的使用</span></h2><table data-lake-id=\"184969cc\" id=\"184969cc\" margin=\"true\" class=\"lake-table\" style=\"width: 750px\"><colgroup><col width=\"375\"><col width=\"375\"></colgroup><tbody><tr data-lake-id=\"u311abfce\" id=\"u311abfce\"><td data-lake-id=\"ub2246207\" id=\"ub2246207\"><p data-lake-id=\"u8de313e0\" id=\"u8de313e0\" style=\"text-align: left\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0031b243\" id=\"u0031b243\">命令</span></p></td><td data-lake-id=\"u66824085\" id=\"u66824085\"><p data-lake-id=\"u05c98230\" id=\"u05c98230\" style=\"text-align: left\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub9053039\" id=\"ub9053039\">说明</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id=\"u32d27b7e\" id=\"u32d27b7e\"><td data-lake-id=\"u3b5126b6\" id=\"u3b5126b6\"><p data-lake-id=\"u24fee0ad\" id=\"u24fee0ad\" style=\"text-align: left\"><span data-lake-id=\"u77dd6894\" id=\"u77dd6894\">tar</span></p></td><td data-lake-id=\"u82a81c45\" id=\"u82a81c45\"><p data-lake-id=\"u000aab4c\" id=\"u000aab4c\" style=\"text-align: left\"><span data-lake-id=\"u673ce34c\" id=\"u673ce34c\">压缩和解压缩命令</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p data-lake-id=\"u96fcb241\" id=\"u96fcb241\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u4608fe69\" id=\"u4608fe69\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u7a6025b4\" id=\"u7a6025b4\">tar命令选项:</span></strong></p><table data-lake-id=\"d5f00219\" id=\"d5f00219\" margin=\"true\" class=\"lake-table\" style=\"width: 750px\"><colgroup><col width=\"375\"><col width=\"375\"></colgroup><tbody><tr data-lake-id=\"ub61df5b3\" id=\"ub61df5b3\"><td data-lake-id=\"ude09fe24\" id=\"ude09fe24\"><p data-lake-id=\"ub85d22e2\" id=\"ub85d22e2\" style=\"text-align: left\"><span data-lake-id=\"u22780c28\" id=\"u22780c28\">选项</span></p></td><td data-lake-id=\"u2e03cb18\" id=\"u2e03cb18\"><p data-lake-id=\"udf79856f\" id=\"udf79856f\" style=\"text-align: left\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua07e4759\" id=\"ua07e4759\">说明</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id=\"u2c50ba98\" id=\"u2c50ba98\"><td data-lake-id=\"uc609a869\" id=\"uc609a869\"><p data-lake-id=\"u64096065\" id=\"u64096065\" style=\"text-align: left\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u5d1c3409\" id=\"u5d1c3409\">-c</span></strong></p></td><td data-lake-id=\"ueb6b4b38\" id=\"ueb6b4b38\"><p data-lake-id=\"ueddac542\" id=\"ueddac542\" style=\"text-align: left\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6ffcc04e\" id=\"u6ffcc04e\">创建打包文件</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id=\"u90d5f172\" id=\"u90d5f172\"><td data-lake-id=\"u35d62cba\" id=\"u35d62cba\"><p data-lake-id=\"u22e3229a\" id=\"u22e3229a\" style=\"text-align: left\"><span data-lake-id=\"u2c4f0f7e\" id=\"u2c4f0f7e\">-v</span></p></td><td data-lake-id=\"u152f6ae7\" id=\"u152f6ae7\"><p data-lake-id=\"u8633e019\" id=\"u8633e019\" style=\"text-align: left\"><span data-lake-id=\"uebbd1bd5\" id=\"uebbd1bd5\">显示打包或者解包的详细信息</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id=\"u1a94058b\" id=\"u1a94058b\"><td data-lake-id=\"ud17f6f74\" id=\"ud17f6f74\"><p data-lake-id=\"ucb8e8795\" id=\"ucb8e8795\" style=\"text-align: left\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf3148cf1\" id=\"uf3148cf1\">-f</span></p></td><td data-lake-id=\"uab3585a7\" id=\"uab3585a7\"><p data-lake-id=\"u40ce0f5c\" id=\"u40ce0f5c\" style=\"text-align: left\"><span data-lake-id=\"uafeac577\" id=\"uafeac577\">指定文件名称, 必须放到所有选项后面</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id=\"u5fe00015\" id=\"u5fe00015\"><td data-lake-id=\"u3cdd0248\" id=\"u3cdd0248\"><p data-lake-id=\"u5df362ba\" id=\"u5df362ba\" style=\"text-align: left\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6c1cf133\" id=\"u6c1cf133\">-z</span></p></td><td data-lake-id=\"ubb6c8114\" id=\"ubb6c8114\"><p data-lake-id=\"u7fa41c0e\" id=\"u7fa41c0e\" style=\"text-align: left\"><span data-lake-id=\"u74f834a1\" id=\"u74f834a1\">压缩或解压缩(.gz)</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id=\"ud63888cc\" id=\"ud63888cc\"><td data-lake-id=\"u746328db\" id=\"u746328db\"><p data-lake-id=\"u512598f3\" id=\"u512598f3\" style=\"text-align: left\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3999b1b5\" id=\"u3999b1b5\">-j</span></p></td><td data-lake-id=\"ud298662f\" id=\"ud298662f\"><p data-lake-id=\"uea2d6ce9\" id=\"uea2d6ce9\" style=\"text-align: left\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5807bd59\" id=\"u5807bd59\">压缩或解压缩(.bz2)</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id=\"u829eaa14\" id=\"u829eaa14\"><td data-lake-id=\"u1211d71c\" id=\"u1211d71c\"><p data-lake-id=\"u1f87a500\" id=\"u1f87a500\" style=\"text-align: left\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u05414ec7\" id=\"u05414ec7\">-x</span></strong></p></td><td data-lake-id=\"u222cb977\" id=\"u222cb977\"><p data-lake-id=\"ucf63ca05\" id=\"ucf63ca05\" style=\"text-align: left\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0990dbd0\" id=\"u0990dbd0\">解包</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id=\"uc51bcb57\" id=\"uc51bcb57\"><td data-lake-id=\"ub726f44c\" id=\"ub726f44c\"><p data-lake-id=\"ud3b954f8\" id=\"ud3b954f8\" style=\"text-align: left\"><span data-lake-id=\"u318a67d0\" id=\"u318a67d0\">-C</span></p></td><td data-lake-id=\"u6c415d90\" id=\"u6c415d90\"><p data-lake-id=\"u8e6972a3\" id=\"u8e6972a3\" style=\"text-align: left\"><span data-lake-id=\"u327dc503\" id=\"u327dc503\">解压缩到指定目录</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22shell%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%E6%89%93%E5%8C%85%3A%20%20tar%20-cvf%20tmp.tar%20tmp%5Cn%E8%A7%A3%E7%BC%A9%E5%8C%85%3Atar%20-xvf%20tmp.tar%5Cn%5Cn%23%20%E6%9C%80%E5%B8%B8%E7%94%A8!!!%5Cn%E6%89%93%E5%8E%8B%E7%BC%A9%E5%8C%85%3A%20tar%20-zcvf%20tmp.tar.gz%20tmp%5Cn%E8%A7%A3%E5%8E%8B%E7%BC%A9%E5%90%A7%3A%20tar%20-zxvf%20tmp.tar.gz%5Cn%5Cntar%E5%92%8Ctar.gz%E7%9B%B8%E4%BA%92%E8%BD%AC%E6%8D%A2%5Cn%E5%8E%8B%E7%BC%A9%3A%20gzip%20tmp.tar%20%20%20%5Cn%E8%A7%A3%E5%8E%8B%E7%BC%A9%3A%20gunzip%20tmp.tar.gz%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22WKPR3%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h2 data-lake-id=\"f6f1c18b\" id=\"f6f1c18b\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud02692ef\" id=\"ud02692ef\">3. zip和unzip命令及选项的使用</span></h2><table data-lake-id=\"7a224f17\" id=\"7a224f17\" margin=\"true\" class=\"lake-table\" style=\"width: 750px\"><colgroup><col width=\"375\"><col width=\"375\"></colgroup><tbody><tr data-lake-id=\"u85da53ec\" id=\"u85da53ec\"><td data-lake-id=\"u7633ef10\" id=\"u7633ef10\"><p data-lake-id=\"ua9708b94\" id=\"ua9708b94\" style=\"text-align: left\"><span data-lake-id=\"u13e5e086\" id=\"u13e5e086\">命令</span></p></td><td data-lake-id=\"u52dba691\" id=\"u52dba691\"><p data-lake-id=\"u74fcdf7a\" id=\"u74fcdf7a\" style=\"text-align: left\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6a175519\" id=\"u6a175519\">说明</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id=\"u142130c0\" id=\"u142130c0\"><td data-lake-id=\"uc609b128\" id=\"uc609b128\"><p data-lake-id=\"u484e9ec5\" id=\"u484e9ec5\" style=\"text-align: left\"><span data-lake-id=\"u25e34b0f\" id=\"u25e34b0f\">zip</span></p></td><td data-lake-id=\"ue95edbc7\" id=\"ue95edbc7\"><p data-lake-id=\"ub7d7c862\" id=\"ub7d7c862\" style=\"text-align: left\"><span data-lake-id=\"u403d01b9\" id=\"u403d01b9\">压缩成.zip格式文件</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id=\"ubd617407\" id=\"ubd617407\"><td data-lake-id=\"uf0288eec\" id=\"uf0288eec\"><p data-lake-id=\"u25e6c0e2\" id=\"u25e6c0e2\" style=\"text-align: left\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3aa28d70\" id=\"u3aa28d70\">unzip</span></p></td><td data-lake-id=\"uda9d0867\" id=\"uda9d0867\"><p data-lake-id=\"u72b6bb5b\" id=\"u72b6bb5b\" style=\"text-align: left\"><span data-lake-id=\"u35a417ff\" id=\"u35a417ff\">解压缩.zip格式文件</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p data-lake-id=\"u297632df\" id=\"u297632df\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"uf20ef9c4\" id=\"uf20ef9c4\